## Commands

| Command           | Action                                      |
| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------- |
| `just check`      | typecheck + lint + format + security + docs |
| `just test`       | run the tests                               |
| `just ci`         | check + tests                               |
| `just format`     | format the code                             |
| `just docs-check` | audit the docs for drift                    |

The stack-specific commands behind these recipes live in the `justfile`.

